# Imported decks and the card definitions generated for them. User data, not
# repository content: every byte here is reproducible from a Moxfield URL.
#
# Ignoring it is not tidiness, it is what makes the two-layer registry hold.
# `pytest` reads the *authored* pool (data/cards, data/decks) and three gates
# assume it is exactly what the repository ships -- test_every_card_works
# parametrises over all of it, test_image_resolution pins the artless set at
# exactly five, ai/encoding builds an embedding index from it. If imports were
# committed, the test suite's answer would depend on what somebody imported last
# week.
#
# Do not remove this file.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
